{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56246","headline":"判简州刺史安太尉申院状希酒场云系州收搉 · 宋光嗣","name":"判简州刺史安太尉申院状希酒场云系州收搉","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"安胡安胡，空有髭须。\n所见不远，智解全愚。\n酒场是太后教令，问你还有耳孔也无。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"宋光嗣","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56246.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56246","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}